    <Description><![CDATA[SynHost block — audio player con waveform rendering, scrubbing, playback rate. DOM: <synergos-audio-player>. Útil para podcasts, audiobooks, entrevistas. Props: audioUrl, trackTitle, artistName.]]></Description>
